  "title": "Safehold Declares Second Quarter 2026 Common Stock Dividend",
  "summary": "NEW YORK, June 15, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Safehold Inc. (NYSE: SAFE) announced today that the Company's Board of Directors has declared common stock dividends of $0.177 per share for the second quarter of 2026. The dividend represents an annualized rate of $0.708 per share and is payable on July 15,",
